{"strongs": "H2892", "word": "טֹּ֫הַר", "translit": "to.har", "root": "טהר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "purity, purifying", "definition": "טֹּ֫הַר noun [masculine] purity, purifying — 1. purity , כְּעֶצֶם הַשָּׁמַיִם לָטֹּ֫הַר Exod 24:10 ( J E ), as the body of heavens for purity. 2. suffix יְמֵי טָהֳרָהּ Lev 12:4 ; Lev 12:6 the days of her purifying (menstruation).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3300')\">BDB3300</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2892')\">H2892</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3299')\">BDB3299</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3301')\">BDB3301</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טֹּ֫הַר</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>purity, purifying</highlightword> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>purity</highlight>, <bdbheb>כְּעֶצֶם הַשָּׁמַיִם לָטֹּ֫הַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 24:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,10)\">Exod 24:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <highlight>as the body of heavens for purity.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> suffix <bdbheb>יְמֵי טָהֳרָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 12:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,4)\">Lev 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 12:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,6)\">Lev 12:6</ref> <highlight>the days of her purifying</highlight> (menstruation). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 24:10", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 24, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Lev 12:4", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 12, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Lev 12:6", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 12, "verse": 6}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["טֹּ֫הַר", "כְּעֶצֶם הַשָּׁמַיִם לָטֹּ֫הַר", "יְמֵי טָהֳרָהּ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["E", "J"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB33